# Copy this file to ".env" for "npm start" and put your free data.gov.in API key after the
# equals sign (no quotes, no spaces). Restart "npm start" after changing it.
# For the live website, add the same variable in Vercel: Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
# The key is only used on the server (api/mandi.js); it is never sent to the browser.
DATA_GOV_API_KEY=
